      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "http:\n/start - set up download process and returns taskId\n/download/:taskId - file stream\n\nws:\nclient -> server:\nsub, { taskId: string }\n\nserver -> client:\nprogress, Task\n\ntype Task: {\n    uuid: string;\n    link: string;\n    stream: Readable;\n    platform: Platform; // maybe not needed\n    downloaded: number;\n    approximateSize: number;\n    status: TaskStatus;\n}\n\nenum TaskStatus {\n    DOWNLOADING\n    READY_TO_SEND\n    SENDING\n    COMPLETED\n}\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28.030534351145036,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "http:\n/start - set up download process and returns taskId\n/download/:taskId - file stream\n\nws:\nclient -> server:\nsub, { taskId: string }\n\nserver -> client:\nprogress, Task\n\ntype Task: {\n    uuid: string;\n    link: string;\n    stream: Readable;\n    platform: Platform; // maybe not needed\n    downloaded: number;\n    approximateSize: number;\n    status: TaskStatus;\n}\n\nenum TaskStatus {\n    DOWNLOADING\n    READY_TO_SEND\n    SENDING\n    COMPLETED\n}\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
